01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
Dear John is a 2010 American romantic war drama film directed by Lasse
Hallström, based on the 2006 novel by Nicholas Sparks.

12
01:12:00,000 --> 01:12:06,000
It follows the life of a soldier (Channing Tatum) after he falls
in love with a young woman (Amanda Seyfried).

13
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:06,000
They decide to exchange letters after he is deployed.

14
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
Dear John was released in North America on February
5, 2010, by Sony Pictures Releasing.

15
